{"t":"PDD","made":"2026-11-12 00:07","name":"PDD Holdings Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Internet Retail","employees":25474,"hq":"Dublin, Ireland","website":"https://www.pddholdings.com","summary_en":"PDD Holdings Inc., a multinational commerce group that owns and operates a portfolio of businesses. The company operates Pinduoduo platform, which provides various product categories and interactive shopping experiences; and Temu, an online platform, which enables merchants to streamline their manufacturing and commercial operations. The company was formerly known as Pinduoduo Inc. and changed its name to PDD Holdings Inc. in February 2023. PDD Holdings Inc. was incorporated in 2015 and is based in Dublin, Ireland.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"PDD Holdings Inc.는 비즈니스 포트폴리오를 소유하고 운영하는 다국적 상거래 그룹입니다. 회사는 다양한 제품 카테고리와 쌍방향 쇼핑 경험을 제공하는 Pinduoduo 플랫폼을 운영합니다. 판매자가 제조 및 상업 운영을 간소화할 수 있는 온라인 플랫폼인 Temu가 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Pinduoduo Inc.로 알려졌으며 2023년 2월 PDD Holdings Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. PDD Holdings Inc.는 2015년에 설립되었으며 아일랜드 더블린에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":79.3,"mcap":112875347968.0,"pe":8.920135,"fpe":6.4157524,"peg":0.6908,"ps":0.25040245,"pb":1.6637118,"ev_ebitda":-3.43,"div":0.0,"beta":-0.079,"hi52":138.5,"lo52":71.94},"fin":{"rev":450775711744.0,"rev_g":0.081,"eps_g":-0.112,"gross":0.56318,"op":0.21863002,"net":0.20426,"roe":0.22745001,"fcf":74635272192.0,"cash":456414003200.0,"debt":4844000256.0,"de":1.082,"eps":8.89,"feps":12.360203},"own":{"short":0.033,"inst":0.29737,"insider":0.0071799997},"analyst":{"n":33,"mean":113.830215,"median":112.53453,"high":151.35336,"low":85.788605,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.02857,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":17,"hold":13,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":4,"buy":17,"hold":12,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":4,"buy":17,"hold":14,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":4,"buy":18,"hold":13,"sell":1,"strongSell":1